   "lines": [
    "As usual I spent the",
    "whole day with my",
    "darling; she is so",
    "bright and bewitching",
    "and yet so tender.",
    "I read aloud to her",
    "(from Hawthorne or",
    "Thackeray) a good deal;",
    "and we are both very",
    "fond of poetry[?] Long-",
    "fellow, and parts of",
    "Shelly and swinbrane[?]."
